MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Try this,

library(ggplot2)

data(diamonds)
dsmall = diamonds[sample(1:nrow(diamonds), 15),]

p =
qplot(carat, price, data=dsmall) + facet_grid( .~clarity)

p + opts(strip.text.x = theme_text(size=5))

HTH,

baptiste

